              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ورق (varaq) — \"a playing card; a sheet (of paper)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "یک دسته ورق در کیف من بود. yek daste varaq dar kif-e man bud. There was a pack of cards in my bag."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "yek daste varaq — a pack of cards. Also a sheet of paper or metal."
            }
          ]
        },
