              "text": "تاس (tâs) — \"a die (pl. dice)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او تاس را انداخت و شش آمد. u tâs râ andâkht va shesh âmad. He threw the die and got a six."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tâs andâkhtan or tâs rikhtan — to roll the dice."
            }
          ]
        },
